# Normalize text files in git storage; materialize CRLF in every checkout for the
# file types whose end-of-line style src/.editorconfig enforces (dotnet format's
# ENDOFLINE check on CI runs on Linux, where git would otherwise check out LF).
* text=auto

*.cs text eol=crlf
*.vb text eol=crlf
*.sln text eol=crlf

*.png binary
